'''Milk''' is an [[:Category:Animal Products|animal product]] obtained from a [[Cow]] by using a [[Milk Pail]]. It can also be obtained from [[Sandy]] on Saturdays, who will comment that the player looks thirsty. Additionally, it is sold by [[Alex]] during the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|10|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]]s.

When a cow has a sufficient [[Animals#Friendship|friendship]] and [[Animals#Mood|mood]] level, it can produce a [[Large Milk]], which is more valuable.

